5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I’m really excited to dig into these proposals. I just worry about relying on things outside our control, like weather or suppliers.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the optimism, Yumi. I’m more concerned we’re ignoring the data from similar past attempts. We shouldn’t judge ideas by their pitch alone.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I observe the room. We assume staff can absorb any new task. I doubt the roster actually holds the required skills.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I focus on how funding is structured. A budget that looks fine at the vote often thins out by year two.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m a bit nervous, but I think where we place things and when we open really decides who can actually reach us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, that’s a great point! I’d love to see those past records. @Shion, do you have specific skills in mind?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, I’ll pull the records. @Shion, I suspect the gap is in supervision, not just raw skill.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, supervision is a gap, yes. But I need to verify if the roster even has the base technical skills before we worry about oversight.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I agree. I need to see the grant terms and endowment rules to understand the long-term cost structure.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
