15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, checking those closures is smart! I’m looking into supplier delivery windows and the old outreach attendance sheets to see what actually worked.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
